{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o171a","title":"曹操令用人不拘偏短","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o171a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操以陈平、苏秦为例，指出进取与德行未必兼具，要求有司不因偏短废才。","evidence":["wudi-e-o171a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"颁求贤令","evidence":["wudi-e-o171a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安十九年十二月乙未","year":214,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o171a-q","wudi-q-o161","wudi-q-b-c4192d9fada3bef44302"],"chronology":"wudi-y214","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o161","basis":"建安十九年十二月乙未","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,966,"O171a"],"order":362}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o171a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dc2f608da2e02a4cb81e","layer":"original","quote":"乙未〖15〗，令曰：“夫有行之士未必能进取〖16〗，进取之士未必能有行也。陈平岂笃行，苏秦岂守信邪〖17〗？而陈平定汉业，苏秦济弱燕。由此言之，士有偏短，庸可废乎〖18〗！有司明思此义〖19〗，则士无遗滞，官无废业矣。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e80ed93e01a75d2ad2bd","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o161","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ba55911420464ee82a49","layer":"original","quote":"十九年春正月〖1〗，始耕籍田〖2〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e3